# Build artifacts.
# - bin/ holds tool binaries (oapi-codegen, tfplugindocs) that
#   `make tools` installs. Versions are pinned in the Makefile;
#   the bins themselves are not source-of-truth.
# - openapi.compat.json is the transient 3.0-downcast form of the
#   canonical 3.1 spec; regenerated on every `make generate` via
#   the jq filter in `compat-spec`. Goes away when oapi-codegen
#   ships 3.1 support (their issue #373).
bin/
internal/client/openapi.compat.json
